>
> Is it possible to directly convert an old style annotation package to the
> new SQLite *.db style packages without rebuilding from scratch?  I didn't
> see anything when poking around and I'm guessing the answer ranges from
> "no" to "patches welcome" but figured it was worth a query.
>
> Thanks
> -J
>
> _______________________________________________
